 "coaching_points": [
  "Warm up 2-3 minutes \u2014 light jog, ankle and hip circles, then easy sole rolls and toe-taps on the ball before going full pace.",
  "Keep the ball within one step of your body the whole way \u2014 tight spaces punish any touch that runs long; use inside and outside of both feet.",
  "Scan up before every gate \u2014 glance at the next gate's angle while your foot is still on the ball, then pick your line early.",
  "Because the gates zig-zag, each exit demands a sharp direction change \u2014 plant, cut across your body, and burst out as if slipping a defender in traffic.",
  "Time cap \u2014 complete all six gates in under 15 seconds with control; a touch that leaves the tight zone or misses a gate voids the rep.",
  "Target: 7 of 10 runs clean through every gate and reaching GF with the ball under control counts as success.",
  "Volume \u2014 6 runs per set, 4 sets; dribbling the ball back from GF to the start (step 7) is your recovery jog and rest.",
  "Safe technique \u2014 cushion each touch with a relaxed ankle and stay on the balls of your feet so you can change direction without losing balance.",
  "This is the solo version \u2014 real tight-space dribbling adds a live defender; add a partner pressing between gates when you can to raise decision load.",
  "Progression \u2014 hit 8/10 clean, shrink gate widths to 0.8m or pull the gates 0.5m closer; if you miss 5, widen the gates back out."
 ],
 "variations": [
  "Weak foot only \u2014 every touch through and between gates with the weak foot.",
  "Outside-only \u2014 beat each gate using just the outside of the boot.",
  "Speed run \u2014 same course, drop the time cap by 2 seconds and keep control."
 ],
